=== STEP 0 — TODAY + ISO WEEK ===
Today = the run date in {{timezone}}. Compute the ISO week key `YYYY-Www` (e.g. 2026-W34) and the Monday→Sunday window. Compute the calendar clock: days to Q3 end and to H2 end.

=== STEP 1 — IDEMPOTENCY (do this before any reading) ===
Using the Gmail connector, list recent SENT mail (search_threads with query `in:sent newer_than:8d`; also list_drafts) and read the subjects. Do NOT search by CJK subject text — Gmail's subject operator is unreliable for 【】 and CJK; list and match yourself. If any sent message's subject starts with `{{routine.subject_prefix}}` and contains this run's ISO week key (e.g. `W34`), STOP and reply exactly: `本週 GM 週報已寄出，略過本次自動寄送（idempotent）` — create nothing.

=== STEP 2 — READ THE MAIN TRACKER (fail loud) ===
Call read_file_content(fileId=`{{sources.main_tracker.id}}`). The connector returns the WHOLE spreadsheet as concatenated markdown tables (all tabs). Find the table whose header row is `# | 主類別 | 子類別 | 項目（正規化）| 重要 | 緊急 | Priority | 負責人 | 協助者 | 開始 | 結束 | 狀態 | 備註` and parse every data row into {id, 主類別, 項目, Priority, 負責人, 協助者, 開始, 結束, 狀態, 備註}, skipping category-header rows. If the read errors or the table cannot be found, STOP, send nothing, and reply exactly: `GM 週報自動化失敗：無法讀取 Main Tracker「{{sources.main_tracker.tab}}」。本次未寄出。`

