00 · Runway（永遠第一行）— from the KPI Dashboard runway/burn rows: `Runway <N> 個月 · burn NT$<x>k / 上限 NT${{constraints.burn_cap_ntd_per_month}} · 帳務截至 <as-of>（來源：KPI Dashboard · <date>）`. RED if N < {{constraints.runway_floor_months}}, or as-of older than {{constraints.books_stale_days}} days, or NO runway Actual exists (then write `RED · Runway 未計量 — KPI Dashboard 的 runway / burn Actual 為空，且排程執行無法讀取帳務資料庫`). AMBER within 0.5 month of the floor. GREEN otherwise.
01 · 只有 GM 能拆的三件事（≤3）— from: OPEN 待決事項 rows past/within 7 days of their 期限 or with no 期限 that block a P0; P0 rows owned by the GM with 結束 ≤14 days; P0 UNDATED. Each: what · why now · what "done" looks like (a stamped record / a date on the tracker / a sent message — never "a conversation"). Three at most.
02 · 兩個時鐘 — 現金時鐘 (from 00; if un-metered say so) · 日曆時鐘 (days to Q3 end {{constraints.q3_end}} and H2 end {{constraints.h2_end}}; every P0/P1 with 結束 ≤30 days: id · item · owner · date; include the course tracker's next milestone End).
03 · P0 / P1 狀態（依 LOB）— one table per 主類別 in tracker order: # · 項目 · 負責人 · 狀態 · derived states · 證據（one clause: tracker row / weekly-log section / sheet row）· 下一步. Every P0 exactly once. P2 only if OVERDUE.
04 · 各 owner 摘要 — one line per owner: P0 · P1 · UNDATED · OVERDUE · ENDS_SOON · asks · 最近一次出現在週報. End with `GM 持有 <k>/<n> 個 P0（<pct>%）`.
05 · KPI 偏離 + 待補數字 — (a) 偏離: rows with BOTH a target and an Actual where Actual misses the current quarter's target; (b) 待補: rows with no Actual → metric · owner · how it would be filled; CRM/accounting-backed ones marked `（排程執行無法讀取 · 待本地補）`. Batch by owner.
06 · 決策登記簿 — table: id · 事項 · label（已定案 / 還在摸索 / 未標）· 決策者 · decide-by（或「無期限」）· 狀態 · 來源. Sources: 待決事項 rows (all, open first); DIRECTION_UNLABELLED P0s (label 未標); the two known strategy-level open decisions if not already listed (課程平台 self-built vs existing on cohort ROAS; 2C high-ticket vs shift to 2B) marked 無期限 unless a date exists.
07 · 本週刻意不做 — 3–5 named skips (e.g. P0s scheduled to start later — protect the date, don't half-start; items whose owner is out; P1/P2 with no date pressure) with one clause each.
08 · 機器健康 — livestream-curation last date (+ flag); SOR docs changed in the last 7 days (or "modifiedTime not exposed — skipped"); sources unavailable in this cloud run (CRM · accounting · calendar); the idempotency result; `STALLED 檢測待 P1`.
